# Strict Security & Public Hygiene Policy for Public GitHub Pages Repository
# Only public HTML, CSS, JS, public images, sitemap, and robots.txt are allowed.

# Block all internal operational logs and Obsidian notes
H_*
*.md
!README.md

# Block all Python automation and test scripts
*.py

# Block all internal JSON logs and payloads (allow sitemap.json)
*.json
!sitemap.json

# Block all environment files and credentials
*.env*
.env

# Block python cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Block debug files
debug_*
test_*
check_*
